        "<b>Professional behaviors</b>: accountability, communication, punctuality, boundaries, receptiveness to feedback, initiative, stress management.",
        "<b>CI communication</b>: agree on feedback style, how to flag uncertainty, and when you can act independently; use weekly planning forms.",
        "<b>Objectives</b>: specific, measurable, time-bound, and written by the student.",
        "<b>CPI 3.0</b>: APTA tool; domains include professionalism, interpersonal, technical/procedural, and business; rated from beginning to beyond entry-level.",
        "<b>Midterm and final</b>: student and CI both rate; discuss differences with examples and convert gaps into objectives.",
        "<b>Safety rule</b>: if unsure or unsafe, stop and ask. Looking competent never outranks patient safety."
