        ["A patient asks a student to connect on personal social media after a good session. What should the student do?", ["Politely decline and keep the relationship professional", "Accept, because the patient asked first", "Accept, but only after the rotation has ended", "Ask the CI to send the request instead"], "Personal social media connections with current patients blur professional boundaries."],
        ["Before a rotation in a hospital, which item is MOST likely to be required by the site?", ["Proof of immunizations and a background check", "A personal letter of reference from a patient", "A completed NPTE practice examination score", "A signed contract to work there after graduation"], "Health and background requirements are standard for patient-facing clinical placements."]
